# Creusot verification artifacts (`cargo creusot`):
# coma translations and the why3find cache are regenerated on every run;
# the tracked pieces are why3find.json (project config) and
# verif/**/proof.json (proof replay metadata) - same split as the
# `cargo creusot new` template.
*.coma
.why3find/
_creusot_erasure/
# Release proof attachments are external objects and are never tracked
release/*/artifacts/
# Editable manuscript assets are maintained separately from the review PDF
/paper/TEX/
/paper/Figures/
